      </ul>

      <p class="ref-cat"><T zh="⑦ 縮寫對照" en="⑦ Abbreviations" /></p>
      <ul class="ref-list abbr-list">
        <li><strong>PAF</strong> — <T zh="可歸因比例（population attributable fraction）——某危險因子若消除，理論上可減少的失智比例" en="population attributable fraction — the share of dementia that could, in theory, be avoided if a risk factor were removed" /></li>
        <li><strong>RR</strong> — <T zh="相對風險（relative risk）" en="relative risk" /></li>
        <li><strong>PM2.5</strong> — <T zh="細懸浮微粒（fine particulate matter，粒徑 ≤2.5 µm）" en="fine particulate matter (aerodynamic diameter ≤2.5 µm)" /></li>
        <li><strong>MCI</strong> — <T zh="輕度認知障礙（mild cognitive impairment）" en="mild cognitive impairment" /></li>
        <li><strong>SCD</strong> — <T zh="主觀認知衰退（subjective cognitive decline）" en="subjective cognitive decline" /></li>
        <li><strong>GBD</strong> — <T zh="全球疾病負擔研究（Global Burden of Disease study，IHME）" en="Global Burden of Disease study (IHME)" /></li>
        <li><strong>NCD-RisC</strong> — <T zh="非傳染病危險因子合作組織（NCD Risk Factor Collaboration）" en="NCD Risk Factor Collaboration" /></li>
        <li><strong>WHO</strong> — <T zh="世界衛生組織（World Health Organization）；GHO 為其全球衛生觀測站" en="World Health Organization; GHO is its Global Health Observatory" /></li>
